    <bpmn:process id="W_W4202" name="W4202. Show Registration, Sponsorship &amp; Space Contracting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Event confirmation; organizer cycle
Frequency: Per event
Volume: Per-event contract (space, sponsorship tier, registrations)
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Legal (VS-100.3)
Participants: Legal (VS-100.3), Finance (VS-17.4), Vendor Mgmt (VS-03), Procurement (VS-34)
Source: workflow W4202 — Show Registration, Sponsorship &amp; Space Contracting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4202_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4202_Lane1" name="Event Marketing Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4202_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4202_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4202_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4202_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4202_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4202_Start3" name="Event confirmation; organizer cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4202_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4202_Task4" name="Event Marketing negotiate/contract show space and sponsorship tier (booth…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Event Marketing negotiate/contract show space and sponsorship tier (booth location, branding rights, speaking slots, lead-list access) with the organizer, per portfolio priority (W4194)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Legal
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4202_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4202_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4202_Task5" name="Event Marketing manage staff/attendee registrations (badges, access, VIP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Event Marketing manage staff/attendee registrations (badges, access, VIP passes) and coordinate with audience targeting (W4196)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4202_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4202_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4202_Task6" name="Event Marketing/Legal manage the contract (payment milestones…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Event Marketing/Legal manage the contract (payment milestones, cancellation/force-majeure, insurance, ABC — links to VS-100.3/VS-86.3), and reconcile spend (W4195)
Responsible (R): Event Marketing Mgr / Legal / Finance
Accountable (A): Event Marketing Mgr
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4202_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4202_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4202_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4202_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4202_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-648 (ensure controlled execution — Exhibition &amp; Trade-Show Operations (PA-139.2).) | - CTL-648: show contract Legal-reviewed (VS-100.3); ABC-compliant (VS-86.3); spend reconciled (W4195)
Owner: Event Marketing Manager / Legal (VS-100.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4202_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4202_Annotation8" targetRef="W4202_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4202_Flow10" sourceRef="W4202_Start3" targetRef="W4202_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4202_Flow11" sourceRef="W4202_Task4" targetRef="W4202_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4202_Flow12" sourceRef="W4202_Task5" targetRef="W4202_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W4202_Flow13" sourceRef="W4202_Task6" targetRef="W4202_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
